# --- AI-assistant instruction + config files (kept LOCAL for the tools, not published) ---
# Per the global GitHub-hygiene rule: a strategy-laden CLAUDE.md / internal AI
# scaffolding should not be public on a competition/portfolio repo. The agent
# still reads these locally (untracked); the public repo stays clean. A neutral,
# judge-friendly build-guide AGENTS.md can be re-added deliberately later if wanted.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md
.cursorrules
.windsurfrules
.aider*
.github/copilot-instructions.md

